        "description": "Electromyographic evidence of myopathic changes",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive proximal limb-girdle muscle weakness plus genetic confirmation of pathogenic TTN variants",
    "notes": "Muscle biopsy and EMG findings support diagnosis but are not mandatory if genetic testing is conclusive."
